- Edges:
    * source: "event_1", target: "entity_1", label: "vendor", sentence: "The purchase was at Chipotle."
    * source: "event_1", target: "datapod:image:ghi...", label: "has_receipt", sentence: "The Chipotle purchase has a receipt."